# The compiled binary. `go build` in this directory names its output after the
# directory, so a bare `go build` followed by `git add -A` commits a ~13 MB
# binary that nothing needs -- the Dockerfile builds from source. This happened
# once in vault-mcp/ and cost 13 MB of permanent history; build-dashboard.yml
# fails the build if it happens here.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash so it means "the file next to this .gitignore",
# not "anything anywhere called dashboard".
/dashboard
